e pieghevole.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/top-stories-2026-05-30-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"top-stories-2026-05-30\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15253,\"date\":\"2026-06-01T12:00:38+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-31T22:38:48+00:00\",\"slug\":\"nuovi-apple-tv-4k-homepod-mini-quasi-pronti-siri-aggiornata-attesa\",\"title\":\"Nuovi Apple TV 4K e HomePod mini “quasi pronti”: Siri aggiornata attesa\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Mark Gurman, Apple TV 4K e HomePod mini sarebbero pronti da mesi, ma il lancio slitterebbe finché non arriva Siri più personalizzata.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/HomePod-mini-and-Apple-TV-Sage-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"HomePod-mini-and-Apple-TV-Sage\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":5,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15249,\"date\":\"2026-06-01T09:30:14+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-31T22:38:19+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-28-piu-significativo-di-ios-27-rumor-gurman\",\"title\":\"iOS 28 sarà “più significativo” di iOS 27: il rumor di Gurman\",\"excerpt\":\"Mark Gurman parla di iOS 28 come di un aggiornamento “far more significant” rispetto a iOS 27, senza però entrare nei dettagli. iOS 28 sarebbe incentrato su un nuovo iPhone.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Low-Angle-iPhone-Purple-768x432.jpg\",\"imageA